<title>USA: Hawaii $55 mln Highway repriced, cuts yld in 2016.</title>
<headline>Hawaii $55 mln Highway repriced, cuts yld in 2016.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney Inc said Thursday it repriced a $55 million State of Hawaii highway revenue bond issue, Series 1996, cutting the yield in 2016 to 5.65 percent from 5.70 percent.  </p>
